( Theory of Operation) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (The barrel-jack input provides the board's primary external power source. Q1 provides reverse-polarity protection with minimal forward voltage drop during normal operation. D5 suppresses positive input-voltage transients, while C22 provides bulk input filtering and C21 provides high-frequency bypassing. The protected supply is distributed as 9V_IN. The input components are selected so that accidental application of an 18 V supply does not damage the board.) Tj
